&ldquo;targets,&rdquo; &ldquo;guidance&rdquo; and similar statements. The Company may also make written or oral forward-looking statements
in its periodic reports to the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (the &ldquo;SEC&rdquo;), in its annual report to shareholders,
in press releases and other written materials and in oral statements made by its officers, directors or employees to third parties. Any
statements that are not historical facts, including statements about the Company&rsquo;s beliefs and expectations, are forward-looking
